## Brand Assets Notice (`assets/brand/`)

The MIT License above applies to all source code (`index.html`, `src/`,
`scripts/`, `server.mjs`) and the procedurally generated character sprites under
`assets/characters/`.

The brand wordmarks and architectural optical-glass stage backdrops under
`assets/brand/` (`simplemkt-wordmark*.png` and `stage-optical-*.webp`) are
proprietary brand assets of SimpleMkt, included solely for live demonstration
and attribution in the original release. If you fork, redistribute, or deploy
this project for your own product or brand, please replace the files in
`assets/brand/` (and the corresponding page title) with your own brand assets.
